      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "i read in this page here that they mention seat locations cannot be more than 2 meters from the vrc_station, however one of my avatars managed to break this exception by spawning in with the seats under the limit and then relocating them with animations http://vrchat.wikidot.com/world-component:vrc-station",
